# packs/finance/evals/credit_memo_v3.jsonl -- the golden set `credit_memo_drafter` v3 binds to.
#
# SYNTHETIC FIXTURE. Every party, facility, filing and figure below is invented. No real
# organisation, borrower or exposure is represented, and none was used to build it.
#
# One JSON object per line; blank lines and `#` comments are not records. The compiler digests the
# WHOLE file (comments included, line endings normalised) and pins that digest into the eval
# binding, so editing a case after the binding was made is visible rather than silent.
#
# Each record carries:
#   id             stable case id
#   ask            what the agent is asked for
#   expect         the fields it must emit, each with the source span it must cite
#   expect_abstain true when the correct behaviour is to decline -- these are the cases the
#                  abstention budget is measured on, and a run that answers them confidently is
#                  worse than one that answers nothing
